Note on third-party video content

The original text and code in this repository (skill instructions, paraphrased
exercise descriptions, scripts, evals) are released under the MIT License
above.

The teaching methods summarized here are based on publicly available YouTube
videos by their respective creators:

- Léa Holistic Training (@leaholistictraining)
- Brieuc Le Dantec (@brieucledantec7422)

Those videos, their transcripts, their images and their wording remain the
intellectual property of their authors. This repository does not include raw
transcripts or video frame screenshots. The summaries are paraphrased for
educational use and must not be presented as official content of the creators.
See README.md for the full list of source URLs. If a creator asks for a
summary to be corrected or removed, please respect that request.
